{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本大阪道頓堀的江崎固力果（Ezaki Glico）「跑跑人」戶外廣告牌一向是當地地標。</p><p>固力果周三（14日）宣布，這塊廣告牌將於11月30日後熄燈，12月1日開始施工更換，預計明年春季重新亮相。</p><p>日本《每日新聞》報道，「跑跑人」姿勢不會改變。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.664377+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:39:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:36.568416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416728+00:00","content_hash":"9fc50aa6bd068a28fced1d3455c0c17d6207f51804ca8b3faf43b4ad5d67cdd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}